        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "Let $\\rho$ be any $(m+1)$-qubit state on $A,X_1,\\ldots,X_m$, where\n$m\\geq3$. Then\n\\begin{equation}\n \\sum_{t=1}^m\\norm{T_{AX_t}}_F^2\\leq m,\\qquad\n \\sum_{t=1}^m v_{X_t|A}^{2/3}\\leq\\frac m3,\\qquad\n \\frac1m\\sum_{t=1}^m v_{X_t|A}\\leq\\frac13.\n\\end{equation}\nThe correlation bound is sharp for every $m\\geq3$.",
